[COLOR=red][SIZE=3][FONT=Arial]Font tag inside details size 3 Arial red[/FONT][/SIZE][/COLOR]
[COLOR=#27F573][SIZE=12px][FONT=Times New Roman][S][U][B][I]Inline style inside details green times new roman strikethrough italic bold underline[/I][/B][/U][/S][/FONT][/SIZE][/COLOR]
