[/SPOILER]

[b]Footnotes:[/b]
[ANAME=fn-1]1[/ANAME]. Mistune does not convert Markdown HTML to AST, hence the need for [icode]html2bbcode[/icode].

[ANAME=fn-2]2[/ANAME]. Currently used for post-processing mistune output. Reference: https://github.github.com/gfm/#raw-html

